# Chapter 1's GIF: The finished task list in motion: moving the cursor and toggling tasks.
# Regenerate with:  python3 tools/scripts/record_media.py gifs --only 1

Output Sources/TerminalUI/TerminalUI.docc/Resources/demo-ch1.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 760
Set Height 460
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type ".build-recordings/tutorial/.build/release/tasks0401"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Up@300ms 2
Sleep 300ms
Space
Sleep 1s

Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 300ms
